  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7b283696-cdb1-4f0c-8e8d-1f07161e1d43.png\"></p>\n<p>《區塊活動追蹤器》是一個簡單的程式庫模組，專門追蹤每個區塊的玩家活動資訊，主要記錄玩家在其中停留的時間。</p>\n<p>此模組本身不會執行任何功能，而是為其他模組開發者提供輔助工具。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4d4ecfc0-0b86-4da7-8e41-c57dc2225ae3.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ChunkActivityTracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a3f2a006-916c-43df-b703-a2e332f070c8.png\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">功能特色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">追蹤每位玩家在每個區塊停留的秒數。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">追蹤每位玩家在每個區塊放置的方塊數量。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">（選配）儲存每個區塊初始且未修改的高度圖資料，供日後參考。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">採用最佳化的二進制儲存格式，於世界存檔資料夾內依維度簡易儲存（已透過 10 萬個區塊的壓力測試）。</li>\n</ul>",
